/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/CHANGELOG.md:15:- **The edge frontier is signed.** A fleet founds with a signed empty genesis frontier, a raise registers into the root's next frontier, and a gate widens toward a device only as of a qualifying frontier, reading `unknown` and waiting where none stands. A frontier signs at its hand's quorum and verifies each link under its own epoch's roster.
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/CHANGELOG.md:53:- **`lares fleet join` serves every face.** `lares fleet join offer|answer --face <i>` joins a device to any face the root holder founded. The root-signed answer carries the charter, the face's household admit, the floor pins and, with `--doc-url`, the document to dial, so a joining node needs no environment variables.
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/CHANGELOG.md:54:- **A fresh browser device stands at the floor.** A new browser boots faceless and reads the oracle under the floor card the banner carries in its `#floor=` link; a face joined through the fleet-join door crosses the sovereign gate under the pin the root signed.
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/CHANGELOG.md:55:- **A herm answers the knock and stands where a Nexus carries it.** `lares nexus carry-for`, `nexus carry --floor-pin` and `nexus carry-take` stand a herm's floor gate at a Nexus whose quorum counted its carry, and a carry bundle brings the other places' counted carries with their floor pins. The founder presents its own face at its own Nexus by self-admit.
