/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/carriage-fold-lane.mem:49:So the herms count the carries from their bundles and read every pin, while A's running daemon sees the pin statements and counts none of the carries it wrote. `place-uncarried` names exactly `carriers.has(placeKey)` failing after the statement's signature, Nexus, route and tier passed (`place-floor-pin.ts`).
