/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pattern-integrities.mem:118:* ''Where the house stands:'' [[kahu|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/kahu#/nexus-scale]] holds the ruled civic shape (per-seat cold pre-rotation, Guardians recover the PERSON; the catastrophe rite stands OPEN and unbuilt), [[identity-classes|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/identity-classes#/the-two-forks]] the layered recovery ruling, and [[field-collision|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/field-collision]] the owed watchers. Each chair's next key rests on its own cold-key card: `lares nexus seal rotate` takes each card back on a terminal and checks it against the head's per-seat digests, and `lares nexus seal cold rehearse` reads a card back, names the chair it would roll, and moves nothing.

